        "kind": "question",
        "knowledgePoint": null,
        "markdown": "$$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{2}{3}{\\left(\\frac{3}{v}\\right)}^{2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{u}\\right)}^{3}=\n$$",
        "mathAcademyId": "q-22530",
        "requiresCalculator": null,
        "solution": "We apply the power of quotient rule and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3}{\\left(\\frac{3}{v}\\right)}^{2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{u}\\right)}^{3} &= \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot \\frac{{3}^{2}}{{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{{1}^{3}}{{u}^{3}} \\\\ &= \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot \\frac{9}{{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{u}^{3}} \\\\ &= \\frac{18}{3{v}^{2}{u}^{3}} \\\\ &= \\frac{6}{{v}^{2}{u}^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "status": "correct",
        "stepId": "17592186682457",
